From 0f90c14207752b9707f647c62bdb28c8a9ea266f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gabriel Fernandez <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Mar 2026 17:37:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 210/913] drivers: clk: don't mix error codes in stm32mp21
 driver

Don't mix error codes in stm32mp21 clock driver: some function return
a TEE_Result value, some return a 0/-1 integer value.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 509d4541ed341c1b21332de439310bb4b58d3cd1 drivers: clk: don't mix error codes in stm32mp21 driver]
Change-Id: Ifab96453d9ccc6f3ed96db0c92a05d99a8503a85
Signed-off-by: Etienne Carriere <etienne.carriere@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/390722
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Tested-by: Gabriel FERNANDEZ <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Gabriel FERNANDEZ <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
---
 core/drivers/clk/clk-stm32mp21.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/core/drivers/clk/clk-stm32mp21.c b/core/drivers/clk/clk-stm32mp21.c
index e5a2ec505..41199b9e2 100644
--- a/core/drivers/clk/clk-stm32mp21.c
+++ b/core/drivers/clk/clk-stm32mp21.c
@@ -1743,8 +1743,8 @@ static int clk_stm32_pll_set_mux(struct clk_stm32_priv *priv __unused,
 
 	if (stm32_mux_set_parent(mux, sel))
 		return -1;
-	else
-		return 0;
+
+	return 0;
 }
 
 static int clk_stm32_pll_check_mux(struct clk_stm32_priv *priv __unused,
